      "side": 1,
      "message": "I originally made the comment on auto toggle entry, but then realized low power mode entry would be the more appropriate choice and I just cut my comment and pasted here. I didn\u0027t realize that I called out auto toggle entry specifically.\n\nSorry that my comment was all messed up.\n\nWhat I meant to say was:\n\nIn low power mode entry I think we should clear TC_FLAGS_WAKE_FROM_LPM since any previous wake attempts are invalid since we haven\u0027t engaged LPM yet.\n\n(I do think we should change this, but it is not a show stopper)",
